Package: nlmixr2llm
Title: LLM Instructions for the 'nlmixr2' Pharmacometrics Ecosystem
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "John", family = "Harrold",
                  email = "john.m.harrold@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Ships agent and skill documentation that helps large language
    models write correct code for the 'nlmixr2' pharmacometrics ecosystem,
    organized around the tasks a pharmacometrician performs: simulation
    ('rxode2', 'nlmixr2lib'), estimation ('nlmixr2', 'nlmixr2extra'), reporting
    ('nlmixr2plot', 'xpose.nlmixr2', 'ggPMX', 'nlmixr2rpt', 'shinyMixR'), and
    interoperability with proprietary software such as 'NONMEM' and 'Monolix'
    ('babelmixr2', 'nonmem2rx', 'monolix2rx'). Provides accessor functions to
    use the content as a system prompt with any large language model client
    (e.g., the 'ellmer' package) and installer functions that write the content
    into the conventions expected by Claude Code, OpenAI Codex CLI, Positron
    Assistant, and other tools that read 'AGENTS.md'.
